# Keep every text file LF in the repository, regardless of the platform that
# checked it out — the editor declares LF and mixed endings created spurious
# diffs. Windows checkouts previously produced a "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
# warning for almost every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.msi binary
*.dmg binary
